/-!
# Native degree-one comparison for an actual short exact sequence

For `0 → F → A → Z → 0`, actual vanishing of `H¹(A)` identifies genuine
`H¹(F)` with the literal quotient of global sections of `Z` by global images
from `A`.  The comparison and its coefficient naturality are the original
positive Ext connecting morphism, not a definition of cohomology.
-/
